Halo Bot
========

Halo Bot is a local clone of the Grok Bot model of working, built from a teardown of that product
rather than from its code. See docs/GROK_BOT_TEARDOWN.md.

Parts of the approval floor, the audit trail, the browser snapshot, the take-the-wheel state and the
retry policy are ports of decisions — and in a few places of logic — from two MIT-licensed projects.
Both are named at the point of use in the source, and the full teardown is in
docs/OPENBOT_HERMES_TEARDOWN.md.

